==Battleground==
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Luke (Enemy)|Luke]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

